{
  "_comment": [
    "THE CONSOLE'S SNAP-INS — an MMC/RSAT-shaped view of the fleet, declared as data.",
    "",
    "WHAT MMC ACTUALLY IS, and therefore what this file models: a shell with a console TREE (scope pane), a",
    "RESULT list per node with columns, and ACTIONS per selected row. Snap-ins plug into that shell. Nothing",
    "about that needs Windows — what needs Windows is the DATA behind each node, and that already comes from",
    "the agent.",
    "",
    "WHY IT IS DATA AND NOT COMPONENTS: a snap-in here is a tree node plus columns plus actions, and every one",
    "of those is a description of something the API can already do. Written as code, each new snap-in would be",
    "a component with its own fetching, its own table and its own drift; written as data, adding 'Shares' is a",
    "block in this file. Same reason the config templates are data.",
    "",
    "NO SECOND DATA PATH — the rule that keeps this from becoming a parallel product. Every `source` points at",
    "an endpoint or a module that ALREADY serves the per-host management screens, and every `action` goes",
    "through the one tool-call endpoint. The console is a PRESENTATION, so a fix in service_facts shows up in",
    "both places or in neither. What the console adds over the per-host tabs is what MMC adds over a single",
    "computer's control panels: one tree, many hosts, uniform nodes and actions.",
    "",
    "AVAILABILITY IS THREE-VALUED, never two. A snap-in is `available`, `unavailable` WITH A REASON (the host",
    "is Linux, the role is not installed, the module is missing), or `unknown` because the host could not be",
    "asked. Hiding the unavailable ones would leave an operator wondering whether Yoloman can manage DHCP at",
    "all; showing them as broken would be a different lie.",
    "",
    "FIELDS:",
    "  requires[]        all must hold: {os_family} | {module} | {feature} (a Windows role/feature name)",
    "  source.kind       'endpoint' (an existing Bossman route) or 'tool' (a module call, params fixed here)",
    "  source.rows       dotted path to the row array in the response; '' means the response IS the array",
    "  columns[].badge   render the value as a state pill rather than text",
    "  actions[].tool    the module to call; {row.<field>} placeholders are filled from the selected row",
    "  actions[].confirm ask before running — for anything that changes a host",
    "  actions[].hide_when  {field, equals}: an action that cannot apply to this row is not offered at all",
    "                       (greying out is the logical answer to an impossible action, not an error after)"
  ],
  "version": 1,
  "snapins": [
    {
      "id": "services",
      "title": "Services",
      "mmc_equivalent": "services.msc",
      "icon": "settings_applications",
      "description": "Every service registered on the host, with its state and start type.",
      "requires": [
        {
          "module": "service_facts"
        }
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "all",
          "title": "Services (local)",
          "source": {
            "kind": "endpoint",
            "path": "/api/v1/agents/{agent_id}/service-units",
            "rows": "services"
          },
          "sort": "name",
          "columns": [
            {
              "key": "name",
              "title": "Name",
              "width": 230
            },
            {
              "key": "display_name",
              "title": "Description",
              "grow": true,
              "fallback": "description"
            },
            {
              "key": "active",
              "title": "Status",
              "badge": true,
              "width": 110
            },
            {
              "key": "enabled",
              "title": "Startup type",
              "width": 130
            },
            {
              "key": "pid",
              "title": "PID",
              "numeric": true,
              "width": 80
            },
            {
              "key": "start_name",
              "title": "Log on as",
              "width": 190
            }
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "id": "start",
              "title": "Start",
              "icon": "play_arrow",
              "tool": "service",
              "params": {
                "name": "{row.name}",
                "state": "started"
              },
              "confirm": true,
              "hide_when": {
                "field": "active",
                "equals": "running"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "stop",
              "title": "Stop",
              "icon": "stop",
              "tool": "service",
              "params": {
                "name": "{row.name}",
                "state": "stopped"
              },
              "confirm": true,
              "hide_when": {
                "field": "active",
                "equals": "stopped"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "restart",
              "title": "Restart",
              "icon": "restart_alt",
              "tool": "service",
              "params": {
                "name": "{row.name}",
                "state": "restarted"
              },
              "confirm": true,
              "hide_when": {
                "field": "active",
                "equals": "stopped"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "local-users",
      "title": "Local Users and Groups",
      "mmc_equivalent": "lusrmgr.msc",
      "icon": "group",
      "description": "The host's local accounts and groups — the local SAM on Windows, passwd/group on Linux.",
      "requires": [
        {
          "module": "getent"
        }
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "users",
          "title": "Users",
          "source": {
            "kind": "endpoint",
            "path": "/api/v1/agents/{agent_id}/accounts",
            "rows": "users"
          },
          "sort": "name",
          "columns": [
            {
              "key": "name",
              "title": "Name",
              "width": 200
            },
            {
              "key": "gecos",
              "title": "Full name",
              "grow": true
            },
            {
              "key": "uid",
              "title": "UID / RID",
              "numeric": true,
              "width": 110
            },
            {
              "key": "system",
              "title": "Built-in",
              "badge": true,
              "width": 100
            },
            {
              "key": "home",
              "title": "Profile / home",
              "width": 240
            }
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "id": "disable",
              "title": "Disable account",
              "icon": "block",
              "tool": "user",
              "params": {
                "name": "{row.name}",
                "enabled": false
              },
              "confirm": true
            },
            {
              "id": "enable",
              "title": "Enable account",
              "icon": "check_circle",
              "tool": "user",
              "params": {
                "name": "{row.name}",
                "enabled": true
              },
              "confirm": true
            },
            {
              "id": "delete",
              "title": "Delete account",
              "icon": "delete",
              "tool": "user",
              "params": {
                "name": "{row.name}",
                "state": "absent"
              },
              "confirm": true,
              "hide_when": {
                "field": "system",
                "equals": true
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "groups",
          "title": "Groups",
          "source": {
            "kind": "endpoint",
            "path": "/api/v1/agents/{agent_id}/accounts",
            "rows": "groups"
          },
          "sort": "name",
          "columns": [
            {
              "key": "name",
              "title": "Name",
              "width": 220
            },
            {
              "key": "gid",
              "title": "GID / RID",
              "numeric": true,
              "width": 110
            },
            {
              "key": "members",
              "title": "Members",
              "grow": true,
              "join": ", "
            }
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "id": "delete",
              "title": "Delete group",
              "icon": "delete",
              "tool": "group",
              "params": {
                "name": "{row.name}",
                "state": "absent"
              },
              "confirm": true,
              "hide_when": {
                "field": "system",
                "equals": true
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "titles": {
        "windows": "Local Users and Groups",
        "default": "Users and Groups"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "eventvwr",
      "title": "Event Viewer",
      "mmc_equivalent": "eventvwr.msc",
      "icon": "inbox",
      "description": "Warnings and errors from the host's own log: the Windows event log, or journald on Linux.",
      "requires": [],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "problems",
          "title": "Warnings and errors",
          "source": {
            "kind": "endpoint",
            "path": "/api/v1/agents/{agent_id}/logs?lines=300&priority=warning",
            "rows": "entries"
          },
          "columns": [
            {
              "key": "time",
              "title": "When",
              "width": 170,
              "kind": "time"
            },
            {
              "key": "priority",
              "title": "Level",
              "badge": true,
              "width": 110
            },
            {
              "key": "unit",
              "title": "Source",
              "width": 220
            },
            {
              "key": "event_id",
              "title": "Event ID",
              "numeric": true,
              "width": 100
            },
            {
              "key": "message",
              "title": "Message",
              "grow": true
            }
          ],
          "actions": [],
          "titles": {
            "windows": "Warnings and errors",
            "default": "Warnings and errors (journald)"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "channels",
          "title": "Channels with records",
          "requires": [
            {
              "module": "windows_eventlog_channels"
            }
          ],
          "source": {
            "kind": "tool",
            "tool": "windows_eventlog_channels",
            "params": {
              "only_with_records": true
            },
            "rows": "channels"
          },
          "sort": "-record_count",
          "columns": [
            {
              "key": "name",
              "title": "Channel",
              "grow": true
            },
            {
              "key": "record_count",
              "title": "Records",
              "numeric": true,
              "width": 120
            },
            {
              "key": "enabled",
              "title": "Enabled",
              "badge": true,
              "width": 100
            },
            {
              "key": "log_mode",
              "title": "Retention",
              "width": 130
            }
          ],
          "actions": []
        }
      ],
      "titles": {
        "windows": "Event Viewer",
        "default": "System log"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "diskmgmt",
      "title": "Disk Management",
      "mmc_equivalent": "diskmgmt.msc",
      "icon": "storage",
      "description": "Disks, partitions and volumes. Read-only here — changing a partition table is the Disks screen, which stages operations and applies them together.",
      "requires": [
        {
          "module": "storage_facts"
        }
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "disks",
          "title": "Disks and volumes",
          "source": {
            "kind": "endpoint",
            "path": "/api/v1/agents/{agent_id}/storage",
            "rows": "block_devices.devices",
            "flatten_children": "children"
          },
          "columns": [
            {
              "key": "name",
              "title": "Device",
              "width": 200,
              "indent_key": "_depth"
            },
            {
              "key": "type",
              "title": "Type",
              "width": 90
            },
            {
              "key": "size",
              "title": "Size",
              "kind": "bytes",
              "numeric": true,
              "width": 120
            },
            {
              "key": "fstype",
              "title": "File system",
              "width": 120
            },
            {
              "key": "mountpoint",
              "title": "Mounted at",
              "width": 200
            },
            {
              "key": "health",
              "title": "Health",
              "badge": true,
              "width": 110
            },
            {
              "key": "model",
              "title": "Model",
              "grow": true
            }
          ],
          "actions": []
        }
      ],
      "titles": {
        "windows": "Disk Management",
        "default": "Disks and volumes"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "features",
      "title": "Roles and Features",
      "mmc_equivalent": "ServerManager.exe",
      "icon": "widgets",
      "description": "Windows Server roles, role services and features, with the install state Windows itself reports.",
      "requires": [
        {
          "os_family": "windows"
        },
        {
          "module": "windows_feature"
        }
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "installed",
          "title": "Installed",
          "source": {
            "kind": "tool",
            "tool": "windows_feature",
            "params": {
              "state": "query",
              "installed_only": true
            },
            "rows": "features"
          },
          "sort": "name",
          "columns": [
            {
              "key": "name",
              "title": "Name",
              "width": 240
            },
            {
              "key": "display_name",
              "title": "Display name",
              "grow": true
            },
            {
              "key": "feature_type",
              "title": "Kind",
              "width": 130
            },
            {
              "key": "install_state",
              "title": "State",
              "badge": true,
              "width": 150
            }
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "id": "plan-remove",
              "title": "Plan removal (-WhatIf)",
              "icon": "science",
              "tool": "windows_feature",
              "params": {
                "name": "{row.name}",
                "state": "absent",
                "dry_run": true
              },
              "confirm": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "available",
          "title": "Available to install",
          "source": {
            "kind": "tool",
            "tool": "windows_feature",
            "params": {
              "state": "query",
              "installed_only": false
            },
            "rows": "features"
          },
          "sort": "name",
          "columns": [
            {
              "key": "name",
              "title": "Name",
              "width": 240
            },
            {
              "key": "display_name",
              "title": "Display name",
              "grow": true
            },
            {
              "key": "feature_type",
              "title": "Kind",
              "width": 130
            },
            {
              "key": "install_state",
              "title": "State",
              "badge": true,
              "width": 150
            }
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "id": "plan-install",
              "title": "Plan install (-WhatIf)",
              "icon": "science",
              "tool": "windows_feature",
              "params": {
                "name": "{row.name}",
                "state": "present",
                "dry_run": true
              },
              "confirm": false
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "programs",
      "title": "Programs and Features",
      "mmc_equivalent": "appwiz.cpl",
      "icon": "apps",
      "description": "What is installed on the host, as its own package database reports it.",
      "requires": [
        {
          "module": "package_facts"
        }
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "installed",
          "title": "Installed programs",
          "source": {
            "kind": "tool",
            "tool": "package_facts",
            "params": {},
            "rows": ""
          },
          "sort": "name",
          "columns": [
            {
              "key": "name",
              "title": "Name",
              "grow": true
            },
            {
              "key": "version",
              "title": "Version",
              "width": 160
            },
            {
              "key": "publisher",
              "title": "Publisher",
              "width": 220
            },
            {
              "key": "arch",
              "title": "Arch",
              "width": 90
            },
            {
              "key": "install_date",
              "title": "Installed",
              "width": 120
            }
          ],
          "actions": [],
          "titles": {
            "windows": "Installed programs",
            "default": "Installed packages"
          }
        }
      ],
      "titles": {
        "windows": "Programs and Features",
        "default": "Installed packages"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rsop",
      "title": "Resultant Set of Policy",
      "mmc_equivalent": "rsop.msc",
      "icon": "policy",
      "description": "Which Group Policy objects apply to this host, which were denied and why — Windows' own declaration, not this system's.",
      "requires": [
        {
          "os_family": "windows"
        },
        {
          "module": "windows_gpresult"
        }
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "applied",
          "title": "Applied policies",
          "source": {
            "kind": "tool",
            "tool": "windows_gpresult",
            "params": {
              "scope": "both"
            },
            "rows": "applied"
          },
          "columns": [
            {
              "key": "name",
              "title": "Policy",
              "grow": true
            },
            {
              "key": "scope",
              "title": "Scope",
              "width": 120
            },
            {
              "key": "som",
              "title": "Linked at",
              "width": 260
            },
            {
              "key": "version",
              "title": "Version",
              "width": 100
            }
          ],
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "denied",
          "title": "Denied policies",
          "source": {
            "kind": "tool",
            "tool": "windows_gpresult",
            "params": {
              "scope": "both"
            },
            "rows": "denied"
          },
          "columns": [
            {
              "key": "name",
              "title": "Policy",
              "grow": true
            },
            {
              "key": "reason",
              "title": "Why it did not apply",
              "width": 300
            },
            {
              "key": "scope",
              "title": "Scope",
              "width": 120
            }
          ],
          "actions": []
        },
        {
          "id": "conflicts",
          "title": "Conflicts with our declarations",
          "source": {
            "kind": "endpoint",
            "path": "/api/v1/agents/{agent_id}/policy-conflicts",
            "rows": "overridden"
          },
          "columns": [
            {
              "key": "name",
              "title": "Value",
              "width": 200
            },
            {
              "key": "path",
              "title": "Key",
              "grow": true
            },
            {
              "key": "value",
              "title": "We declare",
              "width": 140
            },
            {
              "key": "gp_value",
              "title": "The host holds",
              "width": 140
            },
            {
              "key": "source",
              "title": "From scope",
              "width": 120
            }
          ],
          "actions": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
